    {
      "type": "text",
      "text": "A white powder is known to be a mixture of magnesium oxide and aluminium oxide."
    },
    {
      "type": "text",
      "text": "$100\\text{ cm}^{3}$ of $2\\text{ mol dm}^{-3}$ $\\text{NaOH(aq)}$ is just sufficient to cause the aluminium oxide in $x$ grams of the mixture to dissolve."
    },
    {
      "type": "text",
      "text": "The reaction occurring is $\\text{Al}_2\\text{O}_3 + 2\\text{OH}^{-} + 3\\text{H}_2\\text{O} \\rightarrow 2\\text{Al(OH)}_4^{-}$."
    },
    {
      "type": "text",
      "text": "$800\\text{ cm}^{3}$ of $2\\text{ mol dm}^{-3}$ $\\text{HCl(aq)}$ is just sufficient to cause **all** of the oxide in $x$ grams of the mixture to dissolve."
    },
    {
      "type": "text",
      "text": "The reactions occurring are"
    },
    {
      "type": "equation",
      "latex": "\\text{Al}_2\\text{O}_3 + 6\\text{H}^{+} \\rightarrow 2\\text{Al}^{3+} + 3\\text{H}_2\\text{O}"
    },
    {
      "type": "text",
      "text": "and"
    },
    {
      "type": "equation",
      "latex": "\\text{MgO} + 2\\text{H}^{+} \\rightarrow \\text{Mg}^{2+} + \\text{H}_2\\text{O}"
    },
    {
      "type": "text",
      "text": "How many moles of each oxide are present in $x$ grams of the mixture?"
    }
  ],
